From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: plastron
Subject: [PATCH] smartpro_defconfig: the Brick's kernel with the display's
 turn: TrimUI's Smart Pro turns its 1280x720 framebuffer onto the 720x1280
 panel with the G2D (its kernel's config has SUNXI_G2D, G2D_ROTATE and
 SUNXI_DISP2_FB_HW_ROTATION_SUPPORT), which brick_defconfig cut for the
 Brick's landscape panel; back here, with the Smart Pro's set of panels
 (LCD_BRICK_PANEL_SMARTPRO). The device tree's disp node says which turn

---
